    "created_at": "2024-12-16 12:00:00",
    "first_name": "Blevins",
    "known_as": "Blevy, Blevster, Blevity Blev, Blevers, (very occasionally) Clever Blever",
    "last_name": "Barber",
    "likes_eating": "Tuna, tuna flavoured cat food, lots of cat biscuits",
    "likes_to": "Wake people up in the morning by persistently meowing and causing a huge disturbance. Playfully attack people with claws fully retracted while they are trying to go to sleep.",
    "middle_name": "Beans",
    "passed_in": null,
    "profile_photo": "lovely_blevins_lzXE19RqtibK.webp",
    "story": "At a very young age, Blevins was adopted by the Barber family. As a kitten, she was immensely playful and loved constantly grabbing her owners' attention. During her teenage years, she developed a habit of causing mayhem and destruction around the house, which of course was her way of having as much fun as possible. She loves being up high, such as on top of doors and wardrobes, and isn't in the slightest bit scared of slipping off and crashing to ground - a common occurrence. All in all, Blevins is a wonderful cat who loves to be around people, particularly when she has the opportunity to show off her talents in whatever way she can.",
    "updated_at": "2024-12-16 12:00:00",
